        "id": 10970,
        "name": "dedlius",
        "username": "dedlius",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/ccd318/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-15T00:49:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We are very confused as to how Blazing Tornado works.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1. When it enters play, it immediately spawns the tornado and the 6 spaces around it are hazard spaces, correct?</p><p>2. How do you mark the hazard spaces? (or do you just know that they are hazardous cause they are adjacent to the tornado?)</p><p>3. If someone is standing adjacent to (or on the space) that the tornado spawns, are they attacked immediately? or not until the end of their next turn (when hazard spaces activate).</p><p>4. If you choose BT as one of your starting power cards, does it spawn immediately during setup?</p><p>5. What happens if you replace BT with another card, does the tornado disappear and, does it then reappear when you put it back into play?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Some of these questions may be really dumb, but I just want to be absolutely clear as to how it works.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:10.219Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 30,
        "reads": 1,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 150.2,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 10968,
        "topic_slug": "blazing-tornado",
        "display_username": "dedlius",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
