        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>1. Correct.</p><p>2. You just know because it&#39;s next to and on the Tornado.</p><p>3. No, they did not enter the Hazard Space, so they are not instantly attacked. They will not be attacked until the move onto a Hazard Space or end their turn on it.</p><p>4. Yes.</p><p>5. It disappears when the card leaves play. If you play Blazing Tornado again later (note you cannot remove it and play it again on the same turn) it will once again be placed somewhere in Ra&#39;s current Line of SIght.</p>",
