      {
        "id": 114711,
        "name": "dedlius",
        "username": "dedlius",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/ccd318/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-15T01:01:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thank you for the answers. That helps.</p><p>One more question.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you spawn the tornado directly on another character (is that allowed?) they would then be forced to move through a hazard space to get away from it, correct? If not, is there any other way to guarantee that the Tornado will attack someone?</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:46:41.518Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
