        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Thank you for the answers. That helps.</p><p>One more question.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you spawn the tornado directly on another character (is that allowed?) they would then be forced to move through a hazard space to get away from it, correct? If not, is there any other way to guarantee that the Tornado will attack someone?</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
        "admin": false,
