        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-15T01:05:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You can totally put it ontop of somebody. Other than that, there is no way to ensure it will hit somebody, unless you are facing someone who only has Melee attacks and you stand inside of it. Also it&nbsp;serves as a way to control&nbsp;the enemy's&nbsp;movement.</p>",
