        "created_at": "2014-08-15T01:24:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As far as putting it on someone else, it's not a character or a companion, which are the only things forbidden from staying in the same space. You can stack up Glacial Structures, Blazing Tornado, the Monorail, a scenario token, and a character all on one hex if you really wanted.</p>",
